--TEST--
`prepareRename` on the `namespace` keyword is refused, because a keyword is no symbol, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
namespac<|>e Shop;

class User
{
    public string $name = "";
}
--REQUEST--
prepareRename
--EXPECT--
refused: There is nothing to rename here. Put the cursor on a class, a variable, a method, a property, a constant or an enum case.
